{"id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-substitution.md","title":"df-substitution","display":"df-substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-substitution","aliases":["16-df-substitution","Reindexing functor"],"display":"df-substitution","depends_on":["[[16-df-cleavage]]","[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]","[[16-df-functor]]"],"source":"Section 1.4, pp. 47–51 (PDF 67–71)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-substitution</span><span>Reindexing functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Section 1.4, pp. 47–51 (PDF 67–71)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:J\\to K\">\\(v:J\\to K\\)</span> 是基箭头。cleavage、纤维采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*Y\">\\(u^*Y\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*g\">\\(u^*g\\)</span>、函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a> 的唯一构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,Z\\in\\mathcal E_J\">\\(Y,Z\\in\\mathcal E_J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal E_J(Y,Z)\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal E_J(Y,Z)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar u_Y,\\bar u_Z\">\\(\\bar u_Y,\\bar u_Z\\)</span> 是下式定义的旧记号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_I,c_{u,v}\">\\(i_I,c_{u,v}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{NatIso}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"298460dd9013dccf\" href=\"?note=298460dd9013dccf\" title=\"16-thm-substitution-functoriality\">16-thm-substitution-functoriality</a>；该上游明确给出分量、单位律和结合相干律。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a> 的三参数谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar u_Y\\coloneqq\\kappa(u,Y),\\qquad\\bar u_Z\\coloneqq\\kappa(u,Z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar u_Y\\coloneqq\\kappa(u,Y),\\qquad\\bar u_Z\\coloneqq\\kappa(u,Z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nu^*Y&amp;=\\operatorname{dom}\\bar u_Y,\\\\\n\\{u^*g\\}&amp;=\\{h\\in\\mathcal E_I(u^*Y,u^*Z)\\mid\\bar u_Zh=g\\bar u_Y\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(u^*,\\mathcal E_J,\\mathcal E_I)&amp;,\\\\\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_I,\\mathcal E_I}(i_I:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{id}_I)^*)&amp;,\\\\\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_K,\\mathcal E_I}(c_{u,v}:u^*v^*\\Rightarrow(vu)^*)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nu^*Y&amp;=\\operatorname{dom}\\bar u_Y,\\\\\n\\{u^*g\\}&amp;=\\{h\\in\\mathcal E_I(u^*Y,u^*Z)\\mid\\bar u_Zh=g\\bar u_Y\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(u^*,\\mathcal E_J,\\mathcal E_I)&amp;,\\\\\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_I,\\mathcal E_I}(i_I:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{id}_I)^*)&amp;,\\\\\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_K,\\mathcal E_I}(c_{u,v}:u^*v^*\\Rightarrow(vu)^*)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>此入口复用本书中已有的正式构造，不再把对象、箭头与相干同构作为仅有名称的条件。笛卡尔唯一性保证右侧集合为单元素并给出函子律。</li>\n<li>一般 cleavage 给自然同构；split 时其规范分量是恒等。来源：Jacobs, §1.4, pp. 47–51（PDF 67–71）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution-functor","status":"resolved","id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$；$u:I\\to J$、$v:J\\to K$ 是基箭头。cleavage、纤维采用 [[16-df-cleavage]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution-functor","status":"resolved","id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$u^*Y$、$u^*g$、函子 $u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution-functor]] 的唯一构造；$Y,Z\\in\\mathcal E_J$、$g\\in\\mathcal E_J(Y,Z)$。$\\bar u_Y,\\bar u_Z$ 是下式定义的旧记号。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","status":"resolved","id":"298460dd9013dccf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i_I,c_{u,v}$ 及 $\\mathrm{NatIso}$ 采用 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]；该上游明确给出分量、单位律和结合相干律。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 采用 [[16-df-functor]] 的三参数谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"v:J\\to K","display":false},{"tex":"u^*Y","display":false},{"tex":"u^*g","display":false},{"tex":"u^*","display":false},{"tex":"Y,Z\\in\\mathcal E_J","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal E_J(Y,Z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar u_Y,\\bar u_Z","display":false},{"tex":"i_I,c_{u,v}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NatIso}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar u_Y\\coloneqq\\kappa(u,Y),\\qquad\\bar u_Z\\coloneqq\\kappa(u,Z).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nu^*Y&=\\operatorname{dom}\\bar u_Y,\\\\\n\\{u^*g\\}&=\\{h\\in\\mathcal E_I(u^*Y,u^*Z)\\mid\\bar u_Zh=g\\bar u_Y\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(u^*,\\mathcal E_J,\\mathcal E_I)&,\\\\\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_I,\\mathcal E_I}(i_I:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{id}_I)^*)&,\\\\\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_K,\\mathcal E_I}(c_{u,v}:u^*v^*\\Rightarrow(vu)^*)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1821,"backlinks":[{"id":"3ae97efa23f80edf","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$，采用 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$ 是同一基范畴上的带提升选择纤维化，采用 [[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-substitution]]。"},{"id":"035ab4b3b2445fb6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$，采用 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$ 是同一基范畴上的带提升选择纤维化，采用 [[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-substitution]]。"},{"id":"d3d8e252a3a45dba","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；沿 $u:I\\to J$ 的重索引 $u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution]]，纤维采用 [[16-df-fibre]]。"},{"id":"ae1a27a060629395","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]] 的预序纤维化；沿 $u:I\\to J$ 的重索引 $u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution]]。"},{"id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；$u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 沿 $u:I\\to J$，采用 [[16-df-substitution]]。"},{"id":"ef7efb192e321ef0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；$u:I\\to J$，$u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 见 [[16-df-substitution]]。"},{"id":"4be9bd4d5b5cf4ed","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 带指定 cleavage $\\kappa$，见 [[16-df-cleavage]]；$u^*$ 是其重索引，见 [[16-df-substitution]]。不要求分裂。"},{"id":"58e47ffb16d63410","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，采用 [[16-df-regular-fibration]]。固定 cleavage、基底有限积、纤维终对象 $\\top_L$ 与二元积 $\\wedge_L$；$u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution]]，$\\Sigma_{A,B}\\dashv\\pi_{A,B}^*$ 采用 [[16-df-simple-quantification]] 的同一伴随族。所有范畴和构造在足够大的宇宙中编码。"},{"id":"3b40125e21710f48","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这是句法操作。纤维重索引函子见 [[16-df-substitution]]，二者通过项模型联系，不能共用一个未说明的接口。"},{"id":"dc2e7801700f6e9a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-354","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution|df-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["4ea27d39c2af987b","f12a7a1ec4908770","298460dd9013dccf","fc49efccd7348d66"]}